&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;How should this be tested?&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Enable shiro.ini, including &apos;admin&apos; user&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Login with &apos;admin&apos; and enable Interpreter Permissions for any Interpreter, granting access to &apos;role2&apos;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Try to use this Interpreter with &apos;user1&apos;, who belongs to role2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


